  "question": "Which two numbers should be interchanged to make the given equation correct?\n\n46 + 24 - (12 + 19) × 2 + 38 × 6 + 44 ÷ 4 = 262\n\n(Note: Interchange should be done of entire number and not individual digits of a given number.)",
