  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/9f1f11fbb4e091305a6b414e74c3aec25b8d519670a1f3bd65f5bd4eb1bdcd68.png] \n\nGiven equation: 46 + 24 - (12 + 19) × 2 + 38 × 6 + 44 ÷ 4 = 262\n\nOption 1) 6 and 2\n\nTwo numbers need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 46 + 24 - (__**12 + 19**__) × 6 + 38 × 2 + __**44 ÷ 4 **__= 262\n\n⇒ 46 + 24 - __**31 × 6**__ + __**38 × 2**__ + 11 = 262\n\n⇒ __**46 + 24**__ - 186 __**+ 76 + 11**__ = 262\n\n⇒ __**157**____** - 186**__ = 262\n\n⇒ -29 ≠ 262\n\nOption 2) 2 and 4\n\nTwo numbers need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 46 + 24 - (12 + 19) × 4 + 38 × 6 + 44 ÷ 2 = 262\n\n⇒ 46 + 24 - __**31 × 4**__ + __**38 × 6**__ + 22 = 262\n\n⇒**__ 46 + 24__** - 124 **__+ 228 + 22__** = 262\n\n​⇒__** 320 - 124**__ = 262\n\n​⇒ 196 ≠ 262\n\nOption 3) 24 and 38\n\nTwo numbers need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 46 + 38 - (__**12 + 19**__) × 2 + 24 × 6 + __**44 ÷ 4**__ = 262\n\n⇒ 46 + 38 - __**31 × 2**__ + **__24 × 6__** + 11 = 262\n\n⇒ __**46 + 38**__ - 62 __**+ 144 + 11**__ = 262\n\n​⇒ **__239 - 62__** = 262\n\n​⇒ 177 ≠ 262\n\n**Option 4) 24 and 44**\n\nTwo numbers need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 46 + 44 - (__**12 + 19**__) × 2 + 38 × 6 + __**24 ÷ 4**__ = 262\n\n⇒ 46 + 44 - __**31 × 2**__ + __**38 × 6**__ + 6 = 262\n\n⇒ __**46 + 44**__ - 62 __**+ 228 + 6**__ = 262\n\n​⇒ __** 324 - 62**__ = 262\n\n​**⇒ 262 = 262**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"24 and 44\".\n\n193:T1ccc,",
